(e) a container whose only Hide is a usable user category of that profile gets other = hide, while an unusable record, or a key from another profile, does not count;
(f) an existing other / otherDebuffs value is kept;
(g) a second run changes nothing;
(h) situations is stamped where missing, and a stored npc = "blizzard" or zones.raid = false is kept;
(i) an inactive profile is migrated;
(j) a v11 account climbs to v12;
(k) NS.SCHEMA_VERSION == 12, updating the hard-coded 11 at tests/test_database.lua:855.

FilterCompiler, Other:
- def shapes: two keys, kind other, declared before weaponEnchants/U, U still last;
- the Ocon content per aura type, with the provenance pair excluded and dispels included;
- Other Show in R-3 adds nothing;
