FilterCompiler, every view:
- the carrier is the first NEVER-role group;
- the remainder content is base + Ocon + baseIds minus shown token/flag/dispel/provenance, with no include ids;
- no remainder when Other is Shown, when no spell-dependent group exists (owner's #28 shape), or when the remainder conflicts;
- every equals noIds in R-3;
- StructureKey is equal across the three views.

